# iOS Flutter warnings (standing)

Canonical: `docs/IOS_FLUTTER_WARNINGS.md` (retirement criteria live there).
Also: `rules/project/ios-flutter-warnings.md`, `AGENTS.md`.

## UIScene CLI warning

This fork **already** adopted UIScene (`SceneDelegate` / scene manifests /
`FlutterImplicitEngineDelegate`). The Flutter nag is expected with custom
CarPlay + AppDelegate. **Do not** treat it as a failed migration, **do not**
disable the scene manifest (`_UIApplicationSceneManifest`), **do not**
register phone-UI plugins on a second headless `FlutterEngine` (steals
Bluetooth/car skip). Optional CLI silence only:
`flutter.config.enable-uiscene-migration: false` (does not turn off UIScene).

## SPM plugin warning

CocoaPods remains supported. **Do not** force SPM-only iOS while
`flutter_secure_storage`, `flutter_carplay`, `isar_flutter_libs`,
`flutter_to_airplay`, or `flutter_discord_rpc` lack SPM. If a future Flutter
makes SPM a hard error, fix on a dedicated branch via upstream/forks — do not
drop critical plugins casually.

## Scope

These warnings are unrelated to Embedded Tailscale / Music Finder. Do not
block feature work solely to clear the logs until the doc’s retirement
criteria are met — then remove this rule and update `AGENTS.md`.
